# Translation overlays being written. Contract J is enforced by the build, so a
# half-finished overlay in HEAD takes the whole deploy down: that happened on
# 2026-09-01 when a concurrent session's commit swept up de/munich.json at 7 of
# 45 trees. A pass now writes <city>.json.partial and renames it as its last
# action, and this line makes it impossible for anyone else to commit the
# in-between state, whatever they type at git add.
data/i18n/*/*.json.partial
